<h2>Thinking Beyond Student Housing</h2>
<p>Some of our readers start out renting as students and keep renting while they save toward a home of their own. If owning, or even building, is somewhere in your future, the habits you start now matter: paying rent on time, building credit and saving a little each month. When you are curious about the bigger picture, read <a href="/what-beginners-should-look-for-when-buying-a-house/">what beginners should look for when buying a house</a>.</p>

